#: game-state.cpp:120
msgid "Click the pause button again to resume the game."
msgstr "Prema de novo no botón de pausa para continuar a partida."

#: game-state.cpp:129
msgctxt "Not meant like 'You have lost', more like 'Time is up'."
msgid "Game over."
msgstr "Partida rematada."

#: game.cpp:45
msgid ""
"<h3>Rules of Game</h3><p>Your goal is to assemble lines of at least three "
"similar diamonds. Click on two adjacent diamonds to swap them.</p><p>Earn "
"extra points by building cascades, and extra seconds by assembling big lines "
"or multiple lines at one time.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>Regras do xogo</h3><p>O seu obxectivo é artellar liñas de canto menos "
"tres diamantes semellantes. Prema en dous diamantes en contacto para "
"trocalos.</p> <p>Gañe pontos adicionais construindo cachóns, e segundos "
"adicionais xuntando liñas grandes de múltiples liñas dunha vez.</p>"

